      "text": "%spark\n\ndef maxSquaredDoubled(a: Int, b: Int): Int =\n  if (a > b) {\n    val squared = a * a\n    squared * 2\n  }\n  else {\n    val squared = b * b\n    squared * 2\n  }\n\nmaxSquaredDoubled(5, 3)\n\nval divided = try {\n  a / (b - 12)\n}\ncatch {\n  case ae: ArithmeticException => 0\n}\n",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/scala",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
