      "text": "%spark\nval x = 10\n\nvar y = x * 2\n\ny = 11\n\nfor (i <- 1 to 10) yield i * 2\n\ndef max(x: Int, y: Int): Int =\n  if (x > y) x else y\n\nmax(x, y)\n\n",
